<!doctype html>
<html lang="my"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Workspace | Innocreation ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/workspace.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/profile.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/settings.css"></head>
<body class="app-home"><header class="app-header"><a class="app-logo" href="/dashboard">INNOCREATION <span>/ ERP</span></a><div class="account-area"><a class="account-name profile-link" href="/profile" title="My Profile"><%= user.name %><small><%= user.role.split('_').map(s=>s.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s.slice(1)).join(' ') %></small></a><form method="post" action="/logout"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="logout">Logout</button></form></div></header>
<main class="app-workspace workspace-dashboard"><div class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</p><h1>မင်္ဂလာပါ၊ <%= user.display_name||user.name||user.username %></h1></div>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Applications</h2><span>INNOCREATION OPERATIONS</span></div>
<nav class="app-grid" aria-label="ERP applications"><% modules.forEach(mod=>{ %><a class="app-tile" href="/modules/<%= mod.id %>"><span class="app-icon icon-<%= mod.id %>"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><%- mod.icon %></svg></span><h2><%= mod.title %></h2><p><%= mod.subtitle %></p><span class="open-module">Open module <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><% }); %><% if(user.role==='admin'){ %><a class="app-tile" href="/settings"><span class="app-icon icon-settings"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 3-.6 2.1-2 .9-2-.5-2 3.5L4 10.6v2.8L2.4 15l2 3.5 2-.5 2 .9L9 21h4l.6-2.1 2-.9 2 .5 2-3.5-1.6-1.6v-2.8L19.6 9l-2-3.5-2 .5-2-.9L13 3z"/><circle cx="11" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><h2>Settings</h2><p>အသုံးပြုသူနှင့် Role စီမံရန်</p><span class="open-module">Open settings <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><% } %></nav>
<footer class="app-footer"><span>MEMORI · LUXURI · GENTLEMEN’S CLUB · FLORAL</span><span>One workspace. Everyday progress.</span></footer></main></body></html>